 featured fight on the list  while people have been raving over the  gojo fight for an extended period of  time i think that the fight against  mojito doesn't get enough credit it  didn't blow the internet up like gojo's  fight did but i would say that this  fight can go toe-to-toe with that one  and as a finale to the first part of jiu  jitsu kaizen i think he did a damn good  job  the previous fight shows us the first  major display of nanami's abilities when  he takes on mojito  in a chaotic fight that gets interrupted  he does get to show off his time-based  abilities and you've gotta wonder what  can top that  well it turns out it's having the main  character join the frey in a fight that  majito still looks to be in control of  despite the numbers disadvantage  throwing some god tier animation and  very creative powers and it comes as no  surprise how jujitsu kaizen  has quickly risen to the top of the  shonen anime rankings it's an amazing  finish too with yuji powering his way  into domain expansion  saving his mentor and finishing the  battle with a decisive victory  with that we end this list feel free to  comment on any other fights you think  deserve to be on this list  if you enjoyed content like this then  please like and subscribe  you can also check out my other channel  and subscribe to that one if you enjoy  video essays i'm looking forward to  seeing you again in the next one and  i'll see you next time  on vinnie tube  [Music]

